# CR 117.4, 104.3a (the owner's ruling, 2026-11-05): a concession with nothing on the stack restarts the pass sequence too, so
# the step does not end until every player still in has passed again. In a game of three Bot1 plays an Island in their first
# main phase; Bot1 and Bot2 pass, and Bot3, holding priority, concedes. Bot1 gets priority and passes, and the game is still in
# Bot1's first main phase with Bot2 holding priority: it ends only when Bot2 passes again too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Concede
? Step = Main1
? PriorityPlayer = Bot1
Bot1.Pass
? Step = Main1
? PriorityPlayer = Bot2
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Result = InProgress
Bot3.Status = Lost
